# ADR writer

Write an ADR only when a decision is hard to reverse or affects architecture, data, security,
deployment, integrations, or cross-team contracts — not for routine choices.

Name it `docs/adr/ADR-NNNN-short-title.md` (increment N), from
[`docs/templates/ADR-template.md`](../../docs/templates/ADR-template.md). Include context, decision,
why now, alternatives, consequences/tradeoffs, operational impact (migration/rollback), references.
Full guidance: @.cursor/skills/adr-writer/SKILL.md
